  "verseCount": 32,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "11",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "DEU 11"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Love and Obey the",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Love the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God and keep his requirements, his decrees, his laws and his commands always.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Remember today that your children were not the ones who saw and experienced the discipline of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God: his majesty, his mighty hand, his outstretched arm;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the signs he performed and the things he did in the heart of Egypt, both to Pharaoh king of Egypt and to his whole country;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "what he did to the Egyptian army, to its horses and chariots, how he overwhelmed them with the waters of the Red Sea",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "as they were pursuing you, and how the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought lasting ruin on them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It was not your children who saw what he did for you in the wilderness until you arrived at this place,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and what he did to Dathan and Abiram, sons of Eliab the Reubenite, when the earth opened its mouth right in the middle of all Israel and swallowed them up with their households, their tents and every living thing that belonged to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But it was your own eyes that saw all these great things the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "has done.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Observe therefore all the commands I am giving you today, so that you may have the strength to go in and take over the land that you are crossing the Jordan to possess,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and so that you may live long in the land the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "swore to your ancestors to give to them and their descendants, a land flowing with milk and honey.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The land you are entering to take over is not like the land of Egypt, from which you have come, where you planted your seed and irrigated it by foot as in a vegetable garden.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But the land you are crossing the Jordan to take possession of is a land of mountains and valleys that drinks rain from heaven.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is a land the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God cares for; the eyes of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God are continually on it from the beginning of the year to its end.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "So if you faithfully obey the commands I am giving you today—to love the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God and to serve him with all your heart and with all your soul—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then I will send rain on your land in its season, both autumn and spring rains, so that you may gather in your grain, new wine and olive oil.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will provide grass in the fields for your cattle, and you will eat and be satisfied.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Be careful, or you will be enticed to turn away and worship other gods and bow down to them.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'s anger will burn against you, and he will shut up the heavens so that it will not rain and the ground will yield no produce, and you will soon perish from the good land the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.17"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "is giving you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fix these words of mine in your hearts and minds; tie them as symbols on your hands and bind them on your foreheads.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teach them to your children, talking about them when you sit at home and when you walk along the road, when you lie down and when you get up.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Write them on the doorframes of your houses and on your gates,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "so that your days and the days of your children may be many in the land the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.21"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "swore to give your ancestors, as many as the days that the heavens are above the earth.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "If you carefully observe all these commands I am giving you to follow—to love the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.22"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, to walk in obedience to him and to hold fast to him—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "then the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.23"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will drive out all these nations before you, and you will dispossess nations larger and stronger than you.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Every place where you set your foot will be yours: Your territory will extend from the desert to Lebanon, and from the Euphrates River to the Mediterranean Sea.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "No one will be able to stand against you. The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.25"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God, as he promised you, will put the terror and fear of you on the whole land, wherever you go.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "See, I am setting before you today a blessing and a curse—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the blessing if you obey the commands of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God that I am giving you today;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the curse if you disobey the commands of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.28"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God and turn from the way that I command you today by following other gods, which you have not known.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "When the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.29"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God has brought you into the land you are entering to possess, you are to proclaim on Mount Gerizim the blessings, and on Mount Ebal the curses.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "As you know, these mountains are across the Jordan, westward, toward the setting sun, near the great trees of Moreh, in the territory of those Canaanites living in the Arabah in the vicinity of Gilgal.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "You are about to cross the Jordan to enter and take possession of the land the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "DEU.11.31"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "your God is giving you. When you have taken it over and are living there,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "be sure that you obey all the decrees and laws I am setting before you today.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
